    <string-array name="game_tips">
        <item>Anchor your highest tile in one corner and never move it.</item>
        <item>Build a snake pattern: let tiles descend in a zigzag across the board.</item>
        <item>Stick to two or three swipe directions; use the fourth only in an emergency.</item>
        <item>Plan your next few moves before you swipe, not after.</item>
        <item>Combine low-value tiles often so they don\'t clutter the board.</item>
        <item>Keep the bottom row full so your tiles can\'t slide out of place.</item>
        <item>Stay calm when the board gets crowded: one good merge can open up everything.</item>
    </string-array>
